# Intentionally no `engine-strict=true`: pnpm applies it to EVERY dependency,
# and transitive packages (osc-progress 0.3.4 wants node >=24) would then
# refuse to install on the supported Node 22 line (CI red 2026-10-10). The
# >=22.12.0 floor is enforced by scripts/preinstall-check.mjs instead. pnpm
# settings (overrides, onlyBuiltDependencies, minimumReleaseAge) live in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml.
